                {
                  "id": "post-p1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "East Texas Mack is a Mack Truck dealership in Longview, Texas. We have over 40 years of experience and specialize in serving the refuse, construction, and off-road sectors. Our services include a Mack factory-trained service department, knowledgeable parts department, and flexible financing with competitive rates.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "post-p2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We understand the importance of your truck repair needs. That's why we have a comprehensive body shop to meet all your repair requirements. At East Texas Mack, we aim to deliver excellent customer service and build long-term relationships with our clients. You are not just a customer at East Texas Mack; you are part of our family.",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "post-p3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For our new site we've collaborated with our web partner <a href=\"https://www.buzznerd.com/\">Buzznerd.com</a>. Buzznerd has extensive technical experience in web design and internet marketing, and we are proud to utilize their expertise in showcasing our trucks and services.",
